## Landed (D-full + D-disj) — update

D-full and D-disj did NOT land as the two separate pieces sketched
above.  They merged: narrowing now sources candidate ctors from the
deferred function's own `case` arms (Interp.armCtors), not from the
argument's type.  This dissolved the "two-arm parameter infers to an
unresolved meta" blocker that the type-sourced route hit, and made
disjunction fall out (one branch per arm).

- D-full  951bfdf — path-derived sub-metas + SMeta/EMeta bridge.
- D-disj  36eeae3 — arm-sourced enumeration (supersedes the
  "agreed-refinements / backtracking" framing above; still
  first-meet-wins — true fairness remains the Hyper-LogicT item).
- cleanup b2ca9bd — removed the now-dead type-sourced plumbing
  (extractDataCtors / hypTwrEnvDataCtors / hypTwrProgramWithCtors).

Detail + worked examples: narrowing.md (D-full / D-disj sections).
